Title:
eig_ar_m1_b120 - ar m=1 Tong-Lin SAE field-free spectrum; Eta=10; BOX=120

#define BOX 120
#define TongLinV (1.0+16.039*exp(-2.007*Q)-25.543*Q*exp(-4.525*Q)+0.961*exp(-0.443*Q))/Q

Axis: name,order,lowerEnd,upperEnd,functions,nElem
 Phi,1,0.,6.28318530718,expIm[1]
 Eta,10,-1,1,assocLegendre{Phi}
 Rn,14,0.,2.,polynomial,3
 Rn,12,2.,20.,RpowL*polynomial,4
 Rn,12,20.,40.,RpowL*polynomial,5
 Rn,12,40.,BOX,RpowL*polynomial,18
 Rn,30,BOX,Infty,polExp[0.5]

Absorption: kind, axis, theta, radius
ECS,Rn,0.3,BOX

Operator: hamiltonian=1/2<<Laplacian>>+<1><1><-TongLinV>

Eigen: select=SmallReal[80]
